maeotp (0.3.1-0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Provide migration path for HOTP/TOTP keys stored in the pre-0.3.0
    format (hex or ASCII) to the base32 storage used by libcotp
  * Persist a per-token "key type" marker in the tokens DB so stored
    keys are interpreted unambiguously on load, rather than guessed
    by the input heuristic
  * Migrate old-format keys on first load (token_db_migrate_keys):
    hex -> raw bytes -> base32, ASCII -> raw bytes -> base32 for HOTP;
    tag MOTP keys as ASCII. Rewritten DB is saved automatically
  * Add test_migrate covering hex, hex-that-looks-like-base32, and
    ASCII (MOTP) old-format keys, plus DB save/reload round-trip

 -- Sicelo A. Mhlongo <absicsz@gmail.com>  Fri, 25 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000

maeotp (0.3.0-0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Switch to libcotp for HOTP/TOTP (RFC 4226/6238) and base32
  * Replace custom base32 implementation with libcotp base32_encode
  * Replace custom HMAC-SHA1 and dynamic truncation with libcotp get_hotp
  * Store HOTP secrets as base32 strings (auto-converts hex/ascii input)
  * Drop hexadecimal OTP display option (disp_hex) -- libcotp returns decimal only
  * Build-depend on libcotp-dev
  * Drop test_hmac (custom HMAC-SHA1 tests no longer applicable)

 -- Sicelo A. Mhlongo <absicsz@gmail.com>  Thu, 24 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000

